# Transient run artifacts from run_pipeline.py (workdirs, status/marker files).
# These are working aids, regenerated on every run — never deliverables.
_run*/
# The live production workdir (created when --workdir ./_live is used). It holds
# real follower data (master.csv) and the capture-once salvage files — real container
# ids and rescued follower records — so it must never be committed.
_live/
# Defensive: any capture-once salvage dir, wherever a workdir is placed, holds real
# paid data. Belt-and-suspenders in case a run uses a differently-named workdir.
captures/
# Real follower data (PII): the running master history and any dated export, should
# a run ever write them beside the scripts instead of into a subject directory.
master.csv
Followers*.csv
.env
